      "writtenOn": "2026-05-12T23:13:53Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "We discussed during the meeting today and think this is the best approach for dealing with this UCSI limitation. Having the EC poll each of the PDCs would waste a lot of time on boot; we already have so much PDC activity happening then.",
      "parentUuid": "4d26e4ba_0c9b67d0",
